# Claude Code's per-project permission rules. Local and not committed: they
# say what this machine lets an agent do to this repository's issues and pull
# requests under the operator's own GitHub account, which is a property of the
# machine and the account rather than of the code. A committed copy would hand
# the same grants to anybody who clones and runs an agent here.
.claude/settings.local.json
